---
// The Fab Lab landing page — a standalone Astro page (NOT a Starlight doc).
// Recreates site/index.html: Gruvbox-styled hero + info sections.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>The Fab Lab</title>
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="The Fab Lab — a hands-on prototyping and fabrication space at Texas A&M."
		/>
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />

		<!-- No-FOUC theme: honor the docs site's saved choice (Starlight), else the
		     legacy 'theme' key, else system preference. -->
		<script is:inline>
			(function () {
				var t =
					localStorage.getItem('starlight-theme') ||
					localStorage.getItem('theme') ||
					(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light');
				if (t !== 'dark' && t !== 'light') {
					t = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light';
				}
				document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', t);
			})();
		</script>

		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link
			rel="stylesheet"
			href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap"
		/>
	</head>

	<body>
		<nav class="topbar">
			<div class="topbar-inner">
				<a class="brand" href="/">The Fab Lab</a>
				<div class="links">
					<a href="/">Home</a>
					<a href="/docs/">Documentation</a>
					<a href="/safety/">Safety</a>
					<a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<header class="hero">
			<div class="wrap">
				<h1>The Fab Lab</h1>
				<p class="tagline">
					A hands-on prototyping and fabrication space that empowers students to turn ideas into
					reality.
				</p>
				<a class="cta" href="/docs/">Browse the Documentation →</a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main class="wrap">
			<p>
				The Fab Lab is a hands-on prototyping and fabrication space designed to empower students to
				turn ideas into reality. Whether you're working on a personal project, launching a startup,
				completing a class project, or simply exploring how things are made, the lab provides the
				tools, resources, and support to build, test, and iterate quickly.
			</p>

			<div class="quick-facts">
				<div class="fact">
					<div class="label">Location</div>
					<div class="value">Wisenbaker Engineering Building (WEB), Room 121</div>
				</div>
				<div class="fact">
					<div class="label">Hours</div>
					<div class="value">
						12:00 PM – 10:00 PM, 7 days a week<br /><span
							style="font-weight:400;color:var(--fg-muted)">(staffing permitting)</span
						>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<a
				class="discord-cta"
				href="https://discord.gg/Tvn9rsBUWH"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>
				<svg
					class="discord-mark"
					viewBox="0 0 24 24"
					width="24"
					height="24"
					fill="currentColor"
					aria-hidden="true"
				>
					<path
						d="M20.317 4.3698a19.7913 19.7913 0 00-4.8851-1.5152.0741.0741 0 00-.0785.0371c-.211.3753-.4447.8648-.6083 1.2495-1.8447-.2762-3.68-.2762-5.4868 0-.1636-.3933-.4058-.8742-.6177-1.2495a.077.077 0 00-.0785-.037 19.7363 19.7363 0 00-4.8852 1.515.0699.0699 0 00-.0321.0277C.5334 9.0458-.319 13.5799.0992 18.0578a.0824.0824 0 00.0312.0561c2.0528 1.5076 4.0413 2.4228 5.9929 3.0294a.0777.0777 0 00.0842-.0276c.4616-.6304.8731-1.2952 1.226-1.9942a.076.076 0 00-.0416-.1057c-.6528-.2476-1.2743-.5495-1.8722-.8923a.077.077 0 01-.0076-.1277c.1258-.0943.2517-.1923.3718-.2914a.0743.0743 0 01.0776-.0105c3.9278 1.7933 8.18 1.7933 12.0614 0a.0739.0739 0 01.0785.0095c.1202.099.246.1981.3728.2924a.077.077 0 01-.0066.1276 12.2986 12.2986 0 01-1.873.8914.0766.0766 0 00-.0407.1067c.3604.698.7719 1.3628 1.225 1.9932a.076.076 0 00.0842.0286c1.961-.6067 3.9495-1.522 6.0023-3.0294a.077.077 0 00.0313-.0552c.5004-5.177-.8382-9.6739-3.5485-13.6604a.061.061 0 00-.0312-.0286zM8.02 15.3312c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9555-2.4189 2.157-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.9555 2.4189-2.1569 2.4189zm7.9748 0c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9554-2.4189 2.1569-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.946 2.4189-2.1568 2.4189Z"
					></path>
				</svg>
				Join us on Discord
			</a>

			<h2>Our Mission</h2>
			<p>
				Our mission is to cultivate a community of builders who learn by doing. The Fab Lab
				emphasizes practical engineering, rapid prototyping, and creative problem-solving, lowering
				the barrier to making so anyone with an idea can take the first step toward bringing it to
				life.
			</p>

			<h2>What You Can Do Here</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Prototype physical products from concept to functional model</li>
				<li>
					Learn and use tools like 3D printers, laser cutters, CNC machines, and electronics
					workstations
				</li>
				<li>Collaborate with other students across disciplines</li>
				<li>Develop real-world engineering and design skills</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Who It's For</h2>
			<p>
				The Fab Lab is open to both undergraduate and graduate students from all majors. Whether
				you're studying engineering, business, design, or any other field, you'll find a place
				here. No prior experience is required, just a willingness to learn and build.
			</p>

			<h2>Get Involved</h2>
			<p>
				The lab is staffed by trained student leaders who are here to help you get started, answer
				questions, and keep things running smoothly. Students are encouraged to collaborate, share
				knowledge, and work through challenges together, creating an environment where everyone can
				learn and build more effectively.
			</p>
			<p>
				Join our community and stay up to date on lab access, trainings, and events:
				<a href="https://discord.gg/Tvn9rsBUWH">discord.gg/Tvn9rsBUWH</a>
			</p>

			<h2>Trainings</h2>
			<p>
				Each machine in the Fab Lab has an associated operations and safety manual that must be
				reviewed before use. For those looking to go further, guided training assignments are
				available to help users learn each machine's capabilities.
			</p>
			<p>
				All training materials, manuals, and resources can be accessed in
				<a href="/docs/">the documentation</a>.
			</p>

			<h2>Policies</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Food of any kind is NOT permitted in the lab.</li>
				<li>Only fully enclosed drinks are allowed.</li>
				<li>Always clean up after yourself after switching stations.</li>
				<li>Storage of any kind is currently not permitted; take your project with you.</li>
			</ul>

			<div class="notice">
				<strong>Notice:</strong> Use of any Fab Lab equipment indicates that you have read and understood
				the corresponding operations and safety manuals.
			</div>
		</main>

		<footer>
			<div class="wrap">
				The Fab Lab · Texas A&amp;M University · <a href="/docs/">Documentation</a>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
	/* ---- Gruvbox palette (kept in sync with the docs site) ---- */
	:root[data-theme='dark'] {
		--bg: #282828;
		--bg-soft: #32302f;
		--bg-card: #3c3836;
		--fg: #ebdbb2;
		--fg-muted: #a89984;
		--border: #504945;
		--accent: #fabd2f;
		--accent-2: #fe8019;
		--discord-blurple: #5865f2;
		--discord-blurple-hover: #4752c4;
	}
	:root[data-theme='light'] {
		--bg: #fbf1c7;
		--bg-soft: #f2e5bc;
		--bg-card: #f9f5d7;
		--fg: #3c3836;
		--fg-muted: #7c6f64;
		--border: #d5c4a1;
		--accent: #b57614;
		--accent-2: #af3a03;
		--discord-blurple: #5865f2;
		--discord-blurple-hover: #454fbf;
	}

	* {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}
	html,
	body {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	body {
		background: var(--bg);
		color: var(--fg);
		font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
		line-height: 1.65;
		-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
	}
	a {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	a:hover {
		color: var(--accent-2);
	}

	.wrap {
		max-width: 860px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 1.5rem;
	}

	/* ---- Top bar ---- */
	.topbar {
		background: var(--bg-soft);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	}
	.topbar-inner {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
		/* Wrap the nav below the brand instead of overflowing on narrow screens. */
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.topbar .brand {
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--fg);
		text-decoration: none;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.topbar .links {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
	}
	.topbar .links a {
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
	.topbar .links a:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	/* ---- Hero ---- */
	.hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 5rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
		background: var(--bg-soft);
	}
	.hero h1 {
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.hero .tagline {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		max-width: 36rem;
		margin: 0 auto 2rem;
	}
	.cta {
		display: inline-block;
		background: var(--accent);
		color: var(--bg);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
		padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		transition:
			transform 0.12s ease,
			background 0.12s ease;
	}
	.cta:hover {
		background: var(--accent-2);
		color: var(--bg);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	/* ---- Content ---- */
	main {
		padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
	}
	main h2 {
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
	}
	main ul {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}
	main li {
		margin: 0.25rem 0;
	}

	.quick-facts {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}
	.fact {
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
	}
	.fact .label {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}
	.fact .value {
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	/* Discord CTA — same embedded button as the Contact page. */
	.discord-cta {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		background: var(--discord-blurple);
		color: #fff;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		padding: 0.9rem 1.85rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.35);
		transition:
			transform 0.15s ease,
			background 0.15s ease,
			box-shadow 0.15s ease;
	}
	.discord-cta:hover {
		background: var(--discord-blurple-hover);
		color: #fff;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.45);
	}
	.discord-cta:active {
		transform: translateY(0);
	}
	.discord-mark {
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.notice {
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		color: var(--fg-muted);
	}

	footer {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		padding: 2rem 0;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
</style>
